WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.301 --> 00:00:02.268
-Welcome back.
I'm here with Gordon Ramsay.

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.602
The one and only Gordon Ramsay.

00:00:03.602 --> 00:00:06.605
Season 19 of "Hell's Kitchen"
premieres on Thursday.

00:00:06.605 --> 00:00:09.075
And for the first time,
it is in Vegas.

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:11.477
Oh, my goodness.
I could just imagine.

00:00:11.477 --> 00:00:12.946
-[ Chuckles ]
-Oh, no, no, no.

00:00:12.946 --> 00:00:14.747
[ Laughing ] Oh, my goodness.
-Yeah.

00:00:14.747 --> 00:00:18.083
It was that moment on TikTok,
where they go, "Oh, no!"

00:00:18.083 --> 00:00:19.819
That's it.
[ Both laugh ]

00:00:19.819 --> 00:00:22.788
-Yeah, yeah, you can just see,
like, "Oh, gosh,"

00:00:22.788 --> 00:00:24.791
Not only are you gonna make it
through the competition,

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:28.360
can you survive
three weeks in Vegas?

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:30.829
[ Chuckling ] It's like...
-It was crazy.

00:00:30.829 --> 00:00:32.498
Also, I think, for me,

00:00:32.498 --> 00:00:34.767
that's 10 years we've been there
in the restaurants.

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:36.936
And it's one of the most
competitive cities

00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:39.104
anywhere on the planet
for coloring.

00:00:39.104 --> 00:00:42.308
And so to have that kind of
jeopardy and magic

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:45.644
rolled into one
was so exciting.

00:00:45.644 --> 00:00:48.447
And so I think it's
one of the best seasons.

00:00:48.447 --> 00:00:51.484
I'm not just saying that
because it's season 19.

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:52.952
I take that competition
very serious.

00:00:53.152 --> 00:00:54.920 align:start position:0%
 
 
It<00:00:53.185><c>'s</c><00:00:53.218><c> a</c><00:00:53.252><c> c</c><00:00:53.285><c>ul</c><00:00:53.319><c>in</c><00:00:53.352><c>ar</c><00:00:53.385><c>y </c><00:00:53.419><c>bo</c><00:00:53.452><c>ot</c><00:00:53.485><c> c</c><00:00:53.519><c>am</c><00:00:53.552><c>p.</c>

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:58.658
And when we get down to the
top 10, top 8, top 5, top 3,

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:01.460
you want to employ them all,
and they're that good.

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:04.530
So it's quite
a heartfelt season.

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:05.999
It's a tough season.

00:01:05.999 --> 00:01:08.100
But I used to get so excited
with the service,

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:10.236
because a lot of customers
got fed.

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:12.405
It's about bloody time --
19 seasons.

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:14.540
But one thing I used to have
sleepless nights over

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:17.310
was when they go out

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:19.311
on the reward

00:01:19.311 --> 00:01:21.280
and they were out for 24 hours.

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:22.382
I was thinking, "Oh, geez, man.

00:01:22.382 --> 00:01:25.384
Who's turning up
tomorrow morning?

00:01:25.384 --> 00:01:28.020
Security!"
-People go missing?

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:30.890
-They went missing.

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:32.959
But we had
some very good producers.

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:34.961
And you know what Vegas is like.

00:01:34.961 --> 00:01:37.496
It's an amazing place.
-Oh, my gosh.

00:01:37.496 --> 00:01:40.867
-I was on the edge two or three
times, let me tell you.

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:42.902
-Yeah.
I want to talk about

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:45.271
"Gordon Ramsay's
American Road Trip,"

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:46.839
because this sounds
like something

00:01:46.839 --> 00:01:50.543
I would love to do,
but I know it's work.

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:52.779
But you don't make it seem
like work.

00:01:52.779 --> 00:01:54.781
Who's idea was this
to get in an RV

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:57.416
and just go around
all these great culinary spots

00:01:57.416 --> 00:01:58.918
of the country?

00:01:58.918 --> 00:02:02.188
-Yeah, I get a lot of flak
back in the U.K.

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:03.923
about the success in the U.S.

00:02:03.923 --> 00:02:06.025
And they sort of call me,
you know,

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:09.261
"Gordon Ramsay the American."
-Wow!

00:02:09.261 --> 00:02:12.131
-Because they think
I'm so, you know...

00:02:12.131 --> 00:02:14.433
I said to my friend -- I said,

00:02:14.433 --> 00:02:16.669
"I'm gonna show you
what this place is all about.

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:18.204
I'm gonna show you
how good this country is.

00:02:18.204 --> 00:02:21.240
I'm gonna show you how big,
bold, tenacious, ambitious,

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:22.741
and amazing this country is."

00:02:22.741 --> 00:02:30.183
So, Fred, who is an amazing
maître d' over here, sweet guy,

00:02:30.183 --> 00:02:31.717
the only problem is,
he's French,

00:02:31.717 --> 00:02:34.553
so his sense of humor is always
a little bit sort of lagless.

00:02:34.553 --> 00:02:35.955
-[ Laughing ] Oh, my God.

00:02:35.955 --> 00:02:39.392
And then Gino D'Acampo,
who is an amazing Italian chef.

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:42.795
We go back -- Imagine a couple
of your mates from "SNL"

00:02:42.795 --> 00:02:45.832
from 20 years ago,
and so it's like joining up

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:49.335
and traveling across the U.S.
in this amazing RV

00:02:49.335 --> 00:02:52.805
and just showing them
what America is all about.

00:02:52.805 --> 00:02:55.608
-I want to show everyone
a clip from your special.

00:02:55.608 --> 00:02:57.376
Here's a look
at "Gordon Ramsay's

00:02:57.376 --> 00:02:59.312
American Road Trip."
Take a look.

00:02:59.312 --> 00:03:00.947
-You've been digging
for 15 minutes.

00:03:00.947 --> 00:03:02.348
We got one clam.

00:03:02.348 --> 00:03:04.883
-Here we go, here we go,
here we go, here we go!

00:03:04.883 --> 00:03:06.318
-Where?
-This side, this side.

00:03:06.318 --> 00:03:08.287
-Are you sure?
-Put your hand in, Fred.

00:03:08.287 --> 00:03:09.722
-[Bleep] [Bleep].

00:03:09.722 --> 00:03:12.425
-You got it?
-[Bleep] No.

00:03:12.425 --> 00:03:14.427
-Don't lose this thing.
-[Bleep]

00:03:14.427 --> 00:03:16.963
-[Bleep]
Now it's all the way down there.

00:03:16.963 --> 00:03:18.664
-Go down, go down.

00:03:18.664 --> 00:03:20.766
-I've got it, I've got it,
I've got it!

00:03:20.766 --> 00:03:22.302
[Bleep]
-But can you feel it?

00:03:22.302 --> 00:03:24.403
No way.
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:24.403 --> 00:03:27.039
-No way. Yes.

00:03:27.039 --> 00:03:30.209
-Gordon Ramsay --
"Hell's Kitchen returns

00:03:30.209 --> 00:03:32.912
this Thursday at 8:00 p.m.
on Fox.

00:03:32.912 --> 00:03:34.413
And you can see him
in the special

00:03:34.413 --> 00:03:36.182
"Gordon Ramsay's
American Road Trip,"

00:03:36.182 --> 00:03:39.218
airing tomorrow night
at 8:00 p.m., also on Fox.

00:03:39.218 --> 00:03:41.321
Vanessa Kirby joins us
after the break.

00:03:41.321 --> 00:03:43.522
Stick around.
Gordon, best to the family.

00:03:43.522 --> 00:03:45.258
Talk to your wife.
Tell her to call me.

00:03:45.258 --> 00:03:46.759
we got to figure this out.
-[ Laughs ]

